#!args apps/JFNetworker/tests/fixtures/rstp_triangle.jfnet --scenario apps/JFNetworker/tests/scen/rstp_triangle.scn --golden apps/JFNetworker/tests/scen/rstp_triangle.report
# golden scenario: rapid spanning tree (IEEE 802.1w, typed as "rapid-pvst") on three switches in a
